                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Use to love this game in VR but with mouse and keyboard or a gamepad it is completely unplayable. Once you figure out the controls, because changing them dont seem to work at all, but once you figure out what the \"game\" will accept as controls, its all downhill from there! I found that this title is just simply a complete waste of time!",
                        "timestamp_created": 1791315687,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1791315687,
                        "voted_up": false,
                        "votes_up": 0,
                        "votes_funny": 0,
                        "weighted_vote_score": 0.5,
                        "comment_count": 0,
                        "steam_purchase": true,
                        "received_for_free": false,
                        "written_during_early_access": false,
                        "developer_response": "Hi Airteez,\nThis is an interesting comment, because I mostly developed the game and prefer to play it with an xbox controller. You even get extra FX outside of VR so it looks better as a bonus. You should be able to remap to whatever you want. What controller were you using?",
